{"id":"a96ac246609c825b","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution.md","title":"部分应用求值的代换引理","display":"lem-applicative-semantic-substitution — 部分应用求值的代换引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution"],"display":"lem-applicative-semantic-substitution — 部分应用求值的代换引理","depends_on":["[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI partial-term substitution §1.3 and applicative theory §2.1–2.2; local proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-applicative-semantic-substitution — 部分应用求值的代换引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d556225e5f2719e3\" href=\"?note=d556225e5f2719e3\" title=\"72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution\">72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI partial-term substitution §1.3 and applicative theory §2.1–2.2; local proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in X^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in X^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\omega\\to\\mathcal T_X\">\\(\\theta:\\omega\\to\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ \\theta(i)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\">\\(\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ \\theta(i)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 为单值部分应用图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal T_X\">\\(t\\in\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_\\theta\">\\(\\eta_\\theta\\)</span> 在下式通过唯一值构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_\\theta(i):=\\iota a\\in X\\ E_G(\\theta(i),\\eta,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_\\theta(i):=\\iota a\\in X\\ E_G(\\theta(i),\\eta,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in X\\quad E_G(\\widehat\\theta(t),\\eta,a)\\Longleftrightarrow E_G(t,\\eta_\\theta,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in X\\quad E_G(\\widehat\\theta(t),\\eta,a)\\Longleftrightarrow E_G(t,\\eta_\\theta,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项求值的单值性与逐个已定义条件使新环境为全函数。变量分支是定义；常元分支保持。应用分支对两个子项使用归纳假设，再使用完全相同的 G 三元关系，两个方向都成立。若去掉 θ(i) 的有值条件，新环境可能没有该坐标，故不能把该引理直接解释为任意部分值的环境替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d556225e5f2719e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\eta\\in X^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta:\\omega\\to\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ \\theta(i)\\downarrow_{G,\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_\\theta(i):=\\iota a\\in X\\ E_G(\\theta(i),\\eta,a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in X\\quad E_G(\\widehat\\theta(t),\\eta,a)\\Longleftrightarrow E_G(t,\\eta_\\theta,a).","display":true}],"bytes":1615,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continu